{#
  A generated document on its way to the renter (§6.24, §6.26).

  The document is ATTACHED, never linked: an external renter downloads
  nothing from this site, so there is no URL here to hand out and nothing to
  guess. A lost email is resent by a manager, which is the whole recourse —
  and a resend says so in its subject (`document_subject`) rather than in a
  second version of this text.
#}
{% extends 'email/base.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#212529;">{{ document_subject }}</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Bonjour {{ renter_name }},</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
        Vous trouverez en pièce jointe votre <strong>{{ document_label }}</strong> pour la location
        <strong>{{ reference }}</strong> ({{ asset_name }}), du {{ arrival_date }} au
        {{ departure_date }}.
    </p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6c757d;">
        Conservez ce document : il ne peut pas être téléchargé depuis le site. Si vous le perdez,
        demandez-nous simplement de vous le renvoyer.
    </p>
{% endblock %}
